9	 * idle_sleep_seconds controls loop behaviour (read from agent.yaml):
10	 *   0   → single-shot mode: one cycle then exit
11	 *   >0  → continuous: loops indefinitely, sleeping idle_sleep_seconds between cycles
12	 *
13	 * Exit codes:
14	 *   0  normal exit
15	 *   2  agent.yaml invalid
16	 *   3  git clone/pull failed (bootstrap only)
17	 *   4  unexpected fatal error
18	 */
19	
